1
00:00:00,805 --> 00:00:02,010
I want to make a game.

2
00:00:06,335 --> 00:00:10,650
Kleos turns that goal into small steps that build on each other.

3
00:00:14,200 --> 00:00:16,650
First, handle one guess in Python.

4
00:00:17,975 --> 00:00:20,180
Then add a loop for repeated turns.

5
00:00:21,405 --> 00:00:23,610
Next, put your logic into functions.

6
00:00:25,300 --> 00:00:27,770
Stuck? Kleos helps you find the gap.

7
00:00:29,055 --> 00:00:31,050
You make the change and test it.

8
00:00:33,005 --> 00:00:35,720
Explain why it works. See your progress.

9
00:00:37,305 --> 00:00:39,470
Now try new rules and harder challenges.

10
00:00:42,265 --> 00:00:44,710
Practice what is missing. Move on when ready.

11
00:00:47,300 --> 00:00:49,760
Finally, solve a fresh challenge without hints.

12
00:00:52,235 --> 00:00:54,760
Keep your work, and the evidence of your skills.

13
00:00:56,255 --> 00:00:58,850
Kleos. Build the skills to answer it yourself.
